                                                "sense_id": "068fca82-dd35-3b35-b46a-ad193ae5b4c7",
                                                "text": "Trent Alexander-Arnold was prominent in the early running, stepping up from right-back into midfield, calibrating his passing range. He had already teed up Harry Kane for a free header – the captain headed high – when he sent Anthony Gordon clean through."
                                            }
                                        ]
